**`app/auth.py`** — `require_api_key` now reads the `X-API-Key` header, validates it against `VALID_API_KEYS`, raises HTTP 401 on missing/invalid keys, and returns the username on success.

**`app/main.py`** — Four endpoints modified/added:

| Endpoint | Change |
|---|---|
| `GET /tasks` | Added `status`, `priority`, `assigned_to` filters (all optional, combinable) and `page`/`page_size` pagination |
| `POST /tasks` | New — requires auth, validates `project_id` exists (404 if not), auto-generates ID, returns 201 |
| `PUT /tasks/{task_id}` | New — requires auth, partial update via `exclude_unset=True` so only sent fields change, 404 if not found |
| `DELETE /tasks/{task_id}` | New — requires auth, removes and returns the task, 404 if not found |
